#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/solarwinds.rst:35
msgid ""
"At minimum you will need credentials for a user with API and root-level "
"propagating read access, as well as read/write access for target networks "
"and domains. For a quicker solution, you can also use an account with the "
"Power User role in situations where you aren't concerned with providing only"
" the minimum required access."
msgstr ""
"At mínimo you será need credentials para un usuario con API y root-level "
"propagating read acceso, así como read/write acceso para destino networks y "
"domains. For un quicker solution, you puede también use un cuenta con el "
"Power User role in situations donde you aren't concerned con providing solo "
"el mínimo requerido acceso."

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/solarwinds.rst:38
msgid "Consuming SolarWinds in |morpheus|"
msgstr "Consuming SolarWinds in |morpheus|"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/solarwinds.rst:40
msgid ""
"On saving your new integration, SolarWinds networks will be synced and can "
"be viewed by navigating to ``Infrastructure > Network > IP POOLS``. They're "
"also viewable from the detail section of the SolarWinds integration at "
"``Infrastructure > Network > INTEGRATIONS > (your SolarWinds integration) > "
"NETWORK POOLS``."
msgstr ""
"On saving your nuevo integration, SolarWinds networks será be synced y se "
"puede ver by navigating to ``Infrastructure > Network > IP POOLS``. They're "
"también viewable desde el detalle sección of el SolarWinds integration at "
"``Infrastructure > Network > INTEGRATIONS > (your SolarWinds integration) > "
"NETWORK POOLS``."

msgid ""
".. image:: images/integration_guides/networking/solarwinds/networkpools.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: images/integration_guides/networking/solarwinds/networkpools.png"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/solarwinds.rst:45
msgid ""
"Host records can also be viewed here by clicking on the name of a SolarWinds"
" network."
msgstr ""
"Host registros puede también be viewed aquí by clicking on el nombre of un "
"SolarWinds network."

msgid ""
".. image:: images/integration_guides/networking/solarwinds/hostrecords.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: images/integration_guides/networking/solarwinds/hostrecords.png"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/solarwinds.rst:50
msgid ""
"|morpheus| SolarWinds integration does not support zone record syncing "
"despite the presence of the ZONES tab on the integration detail page. This "
"is a UI feature carried over from other networking integrations and is not "
"supported at this time."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| SolarWinds integration no soporta zone registro syncing despite "
"el presence of el ZONES pestaña on la integración página de detalles. This "
"es un UI característica carried over desde otro networking integrations y no"
" es compatible en este momento."

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/solarwinds.rst:53
msgid "Adding IP Pools to Networks"
msgstr "Agregar IP Pools to Networks"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/solarwinds.rst:55
msgid ""
"|morpheus| can automatically assign the next available SolarWinds IP in an "
"IP/Network Pool and create the corresponding DNS records. |morpheus| will "
"also remove the records upon teardown. To enable this, add an SolarWinds "
"IP/Network Pool to the `Network Pool` section on a Network(s)."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| puede automáticamente assign el siguiente disponible SolarWinds "
"IP in un IP/Network Pool y create el corresponding DNS registros. |morpheus|"
" será también remove el registros sobre teardown. To enable este, add un "
"SolarWinds IP/Network Pool to el `Network Pool` sección on un Network(s)."

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/solarwinds.rst:57
msgid "Navigate to ``Infrastructure > Network > Networks``"
msgstr "Navegue un ``Infrastructure > Network > Networks``"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/solarwinds.rst:58
msgid "Select a Network name and click :guilabel:`EDIT`"
msgstr "Select un Network nombre y click :guilabel:`EDITAR`"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/solarwinds.rst:59
msgid ""
"In the NETWORK POOL typeahead field, search for and select the name of the "
"selected IP/Network Pool."
msgstr ""
"En el NETWORK POOL typeahead campo, search para y select el nombre of el "
"seleccionado IP/Network Pool."

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/solarwinds.rst:61
msgid "Gateway, DNS, and CIDR must be populated for static/pool IP assignment"
msgstr "Gateway, DNS, y CIDR debe be populated para static/pool IP assignment"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/solarwinds.rst:62
msgid ""
"Select ALLOW IP OVERRIDE, if desired, to allow selecting between DHCP, "
"static IP address entry, and pool address selection at provision time"
msgstr ""
"Select ALLOW IP OVERRIDE, si se desea, to allow selecting entre DHCP, static"
" IP dirección entry, y pool dirección selection at provision time"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/solarwinds.rst:63
msgid ""
"Deselect DHCP server if a DHCP server will not be used on the network (only "
"static and/or IP Pool IP assignment)"
msgstr ""
"Deselect DHCP server if un DHCP server no be used on la red (solo static y/o"
" IP Pool IP assignment)"

